### Auth Controller

#### [NEW] [AuthController.php](file:///d:/PROJECTS%20RANIEL%20CODES/laravel-game-vault/app/Http/Controllers/AuthController.php)

| Method | Route | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `showLogin()` | `GET /login` | Show login Blade form |
| `login()` | `POST /login` | Validate credentials, call `SupabaseService::signIn()`, store in session, redirect to `/games` |
| `showRegister()` | `GET /register` | Show register Blade form |
| `register()` | `POST /register` | Validate input, call `SupabaseService::signUp()`, auto-login, redirect to `/games` |
| `logout()` | `POST /logout` | Call `SupabaseService::signOut()`, flush session, redirect to `/login` |

Error handling: catches Supabase API errors (invalid credentials, email already exists, etc.) and returns them as flash messages to the Blade forms.

