### Manual Verification

1. Open `http://localhost:8000` → redirects to `/login`
2. Click "Register" → create account → redirects to `/games`
3. Games page shows "No games found" empty state
4. Add a game → it appears in the list
5. Log out → log back in → game is still there (your collection persists)
6. Register a second account → that user sees an empty collection (separate per user)
7. Test CRUD: create, view, edit, delete
8. Test validation: submit empty form → inline errors
9. Test wrong credentials: login with bad password → error message
